  "overview": "The use of Flock Safety technology helps advance the Wilton, CT Police Department\u2019s public safety mission by turning vehicle and license plate information into timely, objective leads that support crime prevention, investigation, and emergency response. By automatically scanning plates and securely checking them against lists of stolen vehicles, wanted suspects, and missing or endangered persons, the technology enables officers to identify threats more quickly and accurately while on patrol. The system also supports solving crimes after they occur by allowing investigators, under policy-driven controls, to review historical vehicle detections connected to specific cases. Clear policies, strict access controls, and regular oversight ensure the technology is used only for legitimate law enforcement purposes. A public transparency portal shows how the technology is deployed, reinforcing community trust and demonstrating that safety, accountability, and respect for privacy go hand in hand.\n\nThe Wilton Police Department currently deploys 11 LPR devices in strategic locations throughout town.\n\n\n\nCommunity Impact",
